\uc1\pard\ulnone\b\f0\fs20 Hostile Worlds\b0\par
\fs16\par
This folder contains challenging settlement maps in hostile environments, where the clonks have to struggle against the forces of nature just to survive, let alone do it long enough to mine resources and build small settlements.\par
\par
Sometimes the very land you stand on is sinking into oblivion or falling apart, and at other times you may find yourself being bombarded by constant rockfalls or being overwhelmed by lava or acid spilling out of the ground.\par
\par
It will be a race against time as the world itself seems to have turned against you - and you will need both quick thinking and skillful control to reach your goals.
}
 